     2539   run write-counter in p-log-handle (substitute("Сохранение..." )) no-error.
     2540   if not v-stop then do:
     2541     _stroka2:
     2542     for each temp-imp
     2543     on error undo _stroka2, next _stroka2 :
     2544       if temp-imp.src-d-card = '':U then next _stroka2.
     2545       num-rec-write = num-rec-write + 1.
     2546       IF NOT temp-imp.src-d-card  = ? then do:
     2547         assign
