     2809                                ,temp-discounts.discnt-value
     2810                                ,temp-ext-discounts.discnt-value
     2811                                ,temp-discounts.pos-type
     2812                                ).
     2813             run err-write2 in this-procedure ( input-output my-mess).
     2814             NEXT _stroka2.
     2815           end.
     2816         end.
